Good Hair is a documentary, comedy film directed by Jeff Stilson.

2
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:46,000
An exposé of comic proportions that only Chris Rock could pull off, GOOD HAIR visits beauty salons and hairstyling battles, scientific laboratories and
Indian temples to explore the way hairstyles impact the activities, pocketbooks, sexual relationships, and self-esteem of the black community.

