00:57:00,000 --> 00:57:06,000
Good Hair is a 2009 American documentary film directed by Jeff Stilson and produced by Chris
Rock Productions and HBO Films, starring and narrated by comedian Chris Rock.

10
01:03:20,000 --> 01:03:26,000
Premiering at the Sundance Film Festival on January 18, 2009, Good Hair had a limited release to theaters in the
United States by Roadside Attractions on October 9, 2009, and opened across the country on October 23.

11
01:09:40,000 --> 01:09:46,000
The film centers on the issue of how African-American women have
perceived their hair and historically styled it.

12
01:16:00,000 --> 01:16:06,000
The film explores the modern-day styling industry for black women, images of what is considered acceptable and desirable
for African-American women's hair in the United States, and their relation to African-American culture.

